# Supabase (accounts / progress sync / leaderboard). Both values are PUBLIC
# (publishable) — RLS is the security boundary. Copy to .env.local (gitignored)
# and fill in from the Supabase project settings. Leaving them empty disables
# every account surface; anonymous play works fully without them.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
